# Line endings are part of this repo's contract, not a preference.
#
# test/readme.test.mjs asserts the README's console blocks equal the CLI's real stdout line
# for line, and test/demo.test.mjs does the same for the demo's three artifacts. On a clone
# made with core.autocrlf=true those comparisons fail for a reason that has nothing to do
# with the change under review. Checking these in is what makes a byte comparison mean the
# same thing on every machine.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
